WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.216
The Discord panel is optional and separate from the browser
panel. Use your own bot and operator account.

00:00:10.216 --> 00:00:18.000
The written Discord guide covers the external application and
permissions steps.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.591
In the Discord developer portal, create your application and
bot, then invite it using the permissions in

00:00:26.591 --> 00:00:35.100
the written guide. External portal screens are not shown here.
Never post a token in chat, a report or a

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.000
screenshot.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:50.346
Enable Developer Mode in Discord. Copy the target channel ID and
your own user ID. Names and channel links

00:00:50.346 --> 00:00:54.000
do not replace numeric IDs.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:07.886
Press B, choose Trading, then Trade. Cycle the top Tools button
to Discord command centre and open it. These

00:01:07.886 --> 00:01:12.000
are the current client controls.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.044
Enter your token in the masked Bot token field, Channel id and
Your Discord user id. Save and read the

00:01:21.044 --> 00:01:30.000
connection status. Keep credentials out of screenshots. Optional
activity feed settings are separate.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:37.158
The Discord, local and hosted panels share the same image
renderer. Select one account or All accounts.

00:01:37.158 --> 00:01:44.664
Money includes order funds, unfilled orders and observed
completion counts alongside auction results. Filled

00:01:44.664 --> 00:01:48.000
orders are delivered stock, not sales or profit.
